{code:java}
for group in `kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --list`
do
 kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --describe --group ${group}
done {code}
Although I have not tested with 380 consumer groups and 500+ topics :)

Which Kafka version are you on now as I would think there has been lots of improvements since 2.7.1.

